  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategic Expertise to the African Union</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall impact of the project is described as: 
AUC reach prioritised goals set in the first 10-year implementation plan of Agenda 2063

There are three outcomes with related outputs: 

Outcome 1. SE-AU deployees contribute substantially towards peace, security and stability in Africa
Outputs: 
1.1. Experts deployed in support of key Peace and Security objectives
1.2. Expertise provided by the  SE-AU projects contribute substantially towards the Peace and Security outcomes 
Outcome 2. Political and institutional capacities of the Commission are enhanced to ensure that Peace and Stability, good governance, democracy and human rights as foundations for development and stable societies are strengthened. 
Outputs: 
2.1.Experts deployed in support of key governance, human rights and institutions objectives
2.2. Expertise provided by the SE-AU project contribute substantially towards the Governance, human rights and institutions outcomes
Outcome 3: Political and Institutional capacities of the Commission are enhanced to ensure sustainable and inclusive growth; harness Africa&#x2019;s demographic dividend; and support its economic transformation
Outputs: 
3.1.	Experts deployed in support of key inclusive development objectives
3.2.	Expertise provided by the SE-AU project contribute substantially towards the Inclusive Development outcomes</narrative>
  </description>
